[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4141.03, "timestamp": "01:09:01", "text": "該死。你真是個失敗者，老兄。你真是個"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4147.59, "timestamp": "01:09:07", "text": "，約翰，你真是個徹頭徹尾的失敗者。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4149.349, "timestamp": "01:09:09", "text": "試著與他和平相處，但他殺了我。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4158.159, "timestamp": "01:09:18", "text": "。 正如我剛才所說，他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4160.799, "timestamp": "01:09:20", "text": "正如我剛才所說，他 腦子裡一直想著跑步。不，我不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4163.88, "timestamp": "01:09:23", "text": "腦子裡一直想著跑步。不，我不 這麼認為。我的天哪。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4173.349, "timestamp": "01:09:33", "text": "哦，你可以改變顏色。好的。是的。  當然"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4179.55, "timestamp": "01:09:39", "text": "請告訴我何時可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4183.43, "timestamp": "01:09:43", "text": "重新開始。準備好？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4187.43, "timestamp": "01:09:47", "text": "是的。我們走吧。你好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4191.43, "timestamp": "01:09:51", "text": "準備好了嗎？準備好了嗎？是的。我，我們走吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4193.829, "timestamp": "01:09:53", "text": "。"}]